# @nocobase/plugin-yeastar-integration

Yeastar P-Series Cloud Edition integration plugin for NocoBase CRM.

## Features

- Click-to-Call via Linkus Web Client
- Screen Pop on incoming calls
- Call logging with CDR capture
- Real-time agent status monitoring
- Queue metrics and wallboards
- AI-powered post-call analytics
- Lead auto-creation from unknown callers

## Installation

This plugin is part of the TCRM (Bank of Africa Kenya CRM) project.

## Configuration

Set the following environment variables:

```
YEASTAR_PBX_DOMAIN=your-pbx-domain.yeastar.cloud
YEASTAR_API_KEY=your-api-key
YEASTAR_WEBHOOK_SECRET=your-webhook-secret
```

## Webhook Endpoints

Configure these webhooks in Yeastar PBX Admin Portal:

- `/yeastar/webhook/call-ringing`
- `/yeastar/webhook/call-answered`
- `/yeastar/webhook/call-ended`
- `/yeastar/webhook/call-missed`
- `/yeastar/webhook/call-failed`
- `/yeastar/webhook/agent-status`
- `/yeastar/webhook/queue-metrics`